# Step 8 — Create Druid Kafka Supervisor

Create datasource:

```
yugabyte_logs
```

Example supervisor:

```json
{
"type":"kafka",

"spec":
{
"dataSchema":
{

"dataSource":"yugabyte_logs",

"timestampSpec":
{
"column":"timestamp",
"format":"iso"
},

"dimensionsSpec":
{
"dimensions":
[
"node",
"level",
"message"
]
},

"metricsSpec":
[
{
"type":"count",
"name":"log_count"
}
]

},

"ioConfig":
{
"topic":"yugabyte-logs",

"inputFormat":
{
"type":"json"
},

"consumerProperties":
{
"bootstrap.servers":
"<kafka-ip>:9092"
}

}

}
}
```

Submit:

```bash
curl -X POST \
http://<overlord-ip>:8090/druid/indexer/v1/supervisor \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d @yb-log-supervisor.json
```

