| VM       | Component                        |
| -------- | -------------------------------- |
| YB-Node1 | Yugabyte + Fluent Bit            |
| YB-Node2 | Yugabyte + Fluent Bit            |
| YB-Node3 | Yugabyte + Fluent Bit            |
| VM-4     | Kafka                            |
| VM-1     | Druid Overlord                   |
| VM-3     | Druid MiddleManager + Historical |
| VM-2     | Grafana/Superset + Druid Broker  |

---

For a stronger enterprise demo, I would add **Prometheus + Grafana** for metrics and keep **Druid for log analytics**. Then you can demonstrate:

* "Is the database healthy?" → Grafana/Prometheus
* "Why did something fail?" → Druid log analytics

That separation mirrors many production observability platforms.



